  "id": "behavior-mapping",
  "term": "behavior mapping",
  "definition": "In this packet, behavior mapping refers to analyzing how differences in brain lesion location relate to differences in task performance, such as error rates or productivity. More specifically, voxel-based lesion-behavior mapping examines these relationships across small brain regions to identify neural systems linked to particular aspects of performance monitoring.",
